{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 43, :comments ["<b>And Ramoth in Gilead.</b> Here it implies that Menasseh had no portion in the land of Gilead, but in the portion of Mattot it is written, ״ויתן משה את הגלעד למכיר בן מנשה.״ It appears to explain that all of them have a portion in the land of Gilead, and so he explains further on, and in the portion of Devarim it is written: ״וחצי הר הגלעד ועריו נתתי לראובני ולגדי,״ and the rest of Gilead I gave to half the tribe of Menasseh."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:51:44.361785629Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}